title: 'statement-store: replace an unreachable routing peer with the next peer of its bucket'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    On the v2 DHT path peer steering now replaces a routing peer that cannot be reached. A peer
    that stays reserved for 15 seconds without an open substream counts as unreachable for 5
    minutes, and the routing selection takes the next peer of its bucket in that time. Before,
    such a peer stayed chosen for ever, and a node whose only peer closer to a topic was
    unreachable lost every statement that entered through it on that topic.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
